<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - September 24.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - September 24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday saw 5,638 fixed-interest five-year bonds maturing on June 12, 2000 trading at 89.40 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 5.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
